window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Holy Grail could save the world…or cost her the man she loves.</b></p> <p>Anna Walker’s hunt for the Grail Cup—the relic of eternal life—puts her directly in Lucifer’s sights. To force her hand, he threatens the one person she cannot lose: her mother. As Anna races to claim the relic, vampiric zealots rise to steal it, and every path is fraught with betrayal.</p> <p>Through it all, Kincade remains her anchor, fighting at her side and determined to keep her from the dark lord’s grasp. But when an unlikely ally with divine power joins their fight, even his strength may not be enough to protect her.</p> <p>With enemies closing in and time running out, Anna must decide how much she is willing to sacrifice—for the relics, for humanity, and for the man who has claimed her heart.</p> <p><b>Narrated by the author. A thrilling, high-stakes continuation for fans of Jim Butcher, Kim Harrison, and supernatural adventure.</b></p>"; 
